              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 8.5: Making a simple water clock"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.681,
            0.743,
            0.719
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Place the upper part of the bottle in an inverted position over the lower half (Fig. 8.5c)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.723,
            0.743,
            0.779
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fill the upper part of the bottle with water. You may add a few drops of ink or colour to make the water level easily visible (Fig. 8.5d)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.784,
            0.743,
            0.841
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The water will start dripping into the lower part of the bottle. Using a watch, mark the level of water after every one minute till all the water drips down."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.845,
            0.744,
            0.921
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Your water clock is ready. Can you now guess how to use it? Pour the water from the lower part back into the top part and watch the level of water dripping into the lower part. Every time it touches a mark made by you, one more minute has passed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "aside_text",
          "index": 24,
